# Copy to .env.local for `bun run dev`. Never commit .env.local.
#
# The simulator needs a language model. Either sign in to Cloudflare once
# (`bunx wrangler login`) to use Workers AI, or put a Gemini API key here
# (free at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey). With both, Workers AI is
# tried first.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
